# Benchmark runs. Only real runs belong here, and they are never committed
# by default: a committed run is a claim, and claims need provenance.
results/*
!results/README.md

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Not committed: this is a library, and pinning dev deps across a 4-Python x 3-OS
# CI matrix causes more resolution trouble than it prevents. CI runs `uv sync`.
uv.lock
